          <td><span data-field="ws_a.total_loss">{{ ws_a.total_loss }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="ws_a.total_income">{{ ws_a.total_income }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div class="section-title">Worksheet B. Worksheet B, Significant Participation Passive Activities With Net Income</div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Name of activity</p>
      <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
          <td style="width: 20%;">(a) Net income</td>
          <td style="width: 20%;">(b) Ratio See instructions</td>
          <td style="width: 30%;">(c) Nonpassive income See instructions</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="ws_b.activity_name">{{ ws_b.activity_name }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="ws_b.income">{{ ws_b.income }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="ws_b.ratio">{{ ws_b.ratio }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="ws_b.nonpassive">{{ ws_b.nonpassive }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Totals</p>
      <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 30%;">Totals</td>
          <td><span data-field="ws_b.total_income">{{ ws_b.total_income }}</span></td>
          <td></td>
          <td><span data-field="ws_b.total_nonpassive">{{ ws_b.total_nonpassive }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Worksheet C. Worksheet C, Passive Activity Loss Limitations</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(a) Enter the net income of each activity from Worksheet A.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">(b) Divide each of the individual net income amounts in column (a) by the total hours of participation in column (a) of Worksheet A. Enter the ratio for each activity as a decimal (rounded to at least three places). The total of these ratios must equal 1.000.</p>
  <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Activity</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Net Income</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Ratio</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
    </tr>
    {% for item in line_items %}
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ line_items[loop.index0].description }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].income">{{ line_items[loop.index0].income }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].ratio">{{ line_items[loop.index0].ratio }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">Worksheet D. Worksheet D, Rental of Nondeplesable Property</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you have net passive income (including prior year unallowed losses) from renting property in a rental activity, and less than 30% of the undeducted basis of the property is subject to depreciation, the net passive income is not considered passive income.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Example. Calvin acquires vacant land for <span data-field="ws_d.cost">{{ ws_d.cost }}</span>, constructs improvements at a cost of <span data-field="ws_d.improvement_cost">{{ ws_d.improvement_cost }}</span>, and leases the land and improvements to a tenant. He then sells the land and improvements.</p>
  <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;"></td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Cost</td>
